			"notes": "## LuckyDraws 2.1.6\n\nThis patch release restores compatibility with Forge 1.20.1 modpacks using Forge 47.3.x.\n\nThis release focuses on draw presentation, administration, and optional-client boundaries.\n\n### Highlights\n\n- A continuous near-miss carousel ending that settles exactly on the winning-cell center.\n- Click-to-skip, static G-key result reopening, varied history replay candidates, and a validated reroll button.\n- Searchable item selection with blacklist/whitelist modes and detailed revision-safe administration.\n- Permission-level-2 benefit draws through the GUI or `/luckydraws grant <targets>`.\n- First-stage datapack-extensible value estimates using `#luckydraws:high_value` and `#luckydraws:force_standard`.\n- Client-only installs remain inert on servers without LuckyDraws; unmodded clients on LuckyDraws servers retain chat fallback.\n\n### Downloads\n\nInstall exactly one file matching both the loader and Minecraft version:\n\n- Forge 1.20.1, Java 17\n- Forge 1.21.1, Java 21\n- NeoForge 1.20.4, Java 17\n- NeoForge 1.21.1, Java 21\n\nNo external dependencies are required."
		},
